            title: '6 Card Omaha',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '6 Card Omaha: six hole cards each, five community cards. Use exactly two hole cards and three board cards for best five-card hand. Pot Limit common; more drawing and stronger hands than 4-card Omaha. 2-9 players.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Omaha poker is a relatively recent casino variant that emerged in the USA in the early 1980s. Six Card Omaha is a modern "Big O" extension in which each player is dealt six hole cards but must still use exactly two hole cards and three board cards at showdown.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Two to nine players. Optimal four to six.',
              },
