                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Type: Standard 52-card deck\nNumber of Decks: 1\nJokers: Not included',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard 52-card deck, chips, table space',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Six hole cards each, face down; then five community cards (flop three, turn one, river one). Dealing clockwise.',
              },
            ],
          },
